cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Green SARC, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "Green SARC"
abstract: >-
  Green SARC is a framework-agnostic, dependency-free Python library that
  applies the SARC governance-by-architecture framework's four enforcement
  sites (Pre-Action Gate, Action-Time Monitor, Post-Action Auditor,
  Escalation Router) to predictive FinOps and GreenOps for agentic AI:
  it forecasts an action's token, USD, and carbon cost before the action
  fires and admits it only if it fits the remaining budget at a calibrated
  confidence level.
type: software
authors:
